  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3962250652620117937,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Suffix Tree.",
      "source_hash": 3843020119122368178,
      "context_hash": 7360636807567172394,
      "translation": "접미사 트리.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024906Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Ukkonen's Algorithm",
      "source_hash": 14284260417003163201,
      "context_hash": 6186611069972862793,
      "translation": "Ukkonen 알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024907Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "*This article is a stub and doesn't contain any descriptions.",
      "source_hash": 8171607097213130395,
      "context_hash": 11421412243621571275,
      "translation": "*이 문서는 아직 작성 중인 문서이며 설명을 담고 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024907Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For a description of the algorithm, refer to other sources, such as [Algorithms on Strings, Trees, and Sequences](https://www.cs.cmu.edu/afs/cs/project/pscico-guyb/realworld/www/slidesF06/cmuonly/gusfield.pdf) by Dan Gusfield.*",
      "source_hash": 12522060130907512954,
      "context_hash": 18203588607178545718,
      "translation": "알고리즘에 대한 설명은 Dan Gusfield의 [Algorithms on Strings, Trees, and Sequences](https://www.cs.cmu.edu/afs/cs/project/pscico-guyb/realworld/www/slidesF06/cmuonly/gusfield.pdf) 같은 다른 자료를 참고하십시오.*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024908Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This algorithm builds a suffix tree for a given string $s$ of length $n$ in $O(n\\log(k))$) time, where $k$ is the size of the alphabet (if $k$ is considered to be a constant, the asymptotic behavior is linear).",
      "source_hash": 3660665181969457205,
      "context_hash": 5807595670281736277,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘은 길이가 $n$인 문자열 $s$가 주어졌을 때 접미사 트리를 $O(n\\log(k))$) 시간에 구축하며, 여기서 $k$는 알파벳의 크기입니다($k$를 상수로 간주하면 점근적 동작은 선형입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024908Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The input to the algorithm are the string $s$ and its length $n$, which are passed as global variables.",
      "source_hash": 8787467337840327931,
      "context_hash": 3525634612238431324,
      "translation": "알고리즘의 입력은 문자열 $s$와 그 길이 $n$이며, 이들은 전역 변수로 전달됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024908Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The main function `build_tree` builds a suffix tree.",
      "source_hash": 5188134285838392333,
      "context_hash": 12873858833364988672,
      "translation": "주 함수 `build_tree`는 접미사 트리를 구축합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024909Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "It is stored as an array of structures `node`, where `node[0]` is the root of the tree.",
      "source_hash": 140247279793067404,
      "context_hash": 5885341430147678793,
      "translation": "트리는 구조체 `node`의 배열로 저장되며, `node[0]`이 트리의 루트입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024909Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "In order to simplify the code, the edges are stored in the same structures: for each vertex its structure `node` stores the information about the edge between it and its parent.",
      "source_hash": 14101355112259853880,
      "context_hash": 15224132093791923653,
      "translation": "코드를 단순화하기 위해 간선도 같은 구조체에 저장합니다. 즉, 각 정점의 구조체 `node`는 그 정점과 부모 사이의 간선에 대한 정보를 저장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "edge": "간선",
        "vertex": "정점"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024910Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Overall each `node` stores the following information:",
      "source_hash": 3503279678598458499,
      "context_hash": 5562013112960498196,
      "translation": "정리하면 각 `node`는 다음 정보를 저장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024911Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`(l, r)` - left and right boundaries of the substring `s[l..r-1]` which correspond to the edge to this node,",
      "source_hash": 9843105684034794912,
      "context_hash": 11789377091388070237,
      "translation": "`(l, r)` - 이 노드로 향하는 간선에 대응하는 부분 문자열 `s[l..r-1]`의 왼쪽 및 오른쪽 경계,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "edge": "간선"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024911Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`par` - the parent node,",
      "source_hash": 578934478660758739,
      "context_hash": 9006696089719444894,
      "translation": "`par` - 부모 노드,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024912Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`link` - the suffix link,",
      "source_hash": 1250051478810690121,
      "context_hash": 13820362982039925063,
      "translation": "`link` - 접미사 링크,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024912Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`next` - the list of edges going out from this node.",
      "source_hash": 13913055686069347466,
      "context_hash": 9385975109063697309,
      "translation": "`next` - 이 노드에서 나가는 간선의 목록.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024912Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Compressed Implementation",
      "source_hash": 8340234650242520218,
      "context_hash": 4175922073560850894,
      "translation": "압축된 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024912Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This compressed implementation was proposed by [freopen](http://codeforces.com/profile/freopen).",
      "source_hash": 4017923447649530818,
      "context_hash": 6560189135168348322,
      "translation": "이 압축된 구현은 [freopen](http://codeforces.com/profile/freopen)이 제안했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:50:37.024913Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Same code with comments:",
      "source_hash": 16091496756340295278,
      "context_hash": 4789543737601750873,
      "translation": "주석이 달린 같은 코드:",
